  "item_short_desc": "<p>Why settle for 1 belt when you can have 2!? Rothco's Camo Reversible Web Belts offer the best of both worlds, featuring a solid color on one side and a camo pattern on the other. Made with durable 100% cotton, these active-duty style web belts are fully adjustable and can easily be trimmed or cut down for the perfect fit. The secure metal buckle keeps the belt in place, while the detachable buckle also allows for customization in both length and style.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "6726",
  "description": "<p>Why settle for 1 belt when you can have 2!? Rothco's Camo Reversible Web Belts offer the best of both worlds, featuring a solid color on one side and a camo pattern on the other. Made with durable 100% cotton, these active-duty style web belts are fully adjustable and can easily be trimmed or cut down for the perfect fit. The secure metal buckle keeps the belt in place, while the detachable buckle also allows for customization in both length and style. With a width of 1.25 inches, these web belts will fit your BDU pants, cargo shorts, uniform, jeans, and more! Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
